Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Run the Multiframe Training window's Start button as a
 batch

TrainRunner::start_multiframe drives run_multiframe and re-uploads the
viewer cameras for each frame. The window gains the frame range,
iterations per frame, learning-rate scale and output folder controls,
and a frame counter.
